==Finnish==
{{Finnish index|p|u}}

===Etymology===
From {{suffix|puhella|in|lang=fi}}. First instance in the ''[[w:Uusimaa (newspaper)|Uusimaa]]'' newspaper in 1897.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|[ˈpuɦelin]|lang=fi}}
* {{hyphenation|pu|he|lin|lang=fi}}

